# Bot1's Takklemaggot enchants Bot2's Memnite. At Bot2's upkeep the -0/-1 counter kills it, and Bot2 - the dead creature's
# controller - chooses a creature Takklemaggot could enchant: Bot1's Humble Budoka, which has shroud (not targeted, the
# ruling), but not Bot1's White Knight, which has protection from black (CR 303.4f, 702.16c), and Bot2 can't choose none
# while there is one (the ruling). Takklemaggot returns attached to the Budoka under Bot1's control, and at Bot1's upkeep puts a -0/-1 counter on it (CR 608.2k).
[Bot1 Deck]
Takklemaggot
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
White Knight
Humble Budoka
Plains
Swamp
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.White Knight.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Humble Budoka.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Takklemaggot.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Takklemaggot.AttachedTo = Memnite
! Bot2.Choose(White Knight)
! Bot2.Choose()
Bot2.Choose(Humble Budoka)
? Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
? Bot1.Battlefield.Takklemaggot.AttachedTo = Humble Budoka
? Bot1.Battlefield.Humble Budoka.Counters.Plus0Minus1 = (absent)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Takklemaggot.AttachedTo = Humble Budoka
Bot1.Battlefield.Takklemaggot.Subtypes = Aura
Bot1.Battlefield.Humble Budoka.Counters.Plus0Minus1 = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Humble Budoka.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Humble Budoka.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.White Knight.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Life = 20
